  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247324/description_46e30aff-0bfd-4ef5-9bbf-d4c1818f1262.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"235\"></p><p>Вариант коровы с новыми анимациями для Mizuno Craft16.<strong><br></strong></p><p><strong>Требования:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a></strong><strong> или <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a><br></strong><strong>Естественное спавнинг: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fCow%2523Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вики</a><br></strong><del></del></p><p><strong><del>Несовместимо: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варианты коров от Mizuno</a></del></strong></p><p><strong>Все мои дополнения для Mizuno.<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Неофициальные Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https: